  "sdo:name": "Lusophone Hub of the Ocean Decade",
  "sdo:description": "This Decade Action will focus on improving access to data and knowledge available to policymakers in order to improve public policies and address relevant issues in a transversal way (considering the law of the sea, interactive governance, environmental management, international relations, oceanography, blue economy, etc.). This project will create an environment that promotes engagement, strengthen partnerships, and disseminate knowledge among Lusophone countries to achieve the ocean we want.",
